      <p>A garage is dead space in most homes. A dumping ground for boxes and a bike nobody uses. Homeowners know they're sitting on a whole room's worth of house they're not using, they just don't always realise how achievable converting it is. Show them a garage turned into a proper living room, office or gym, and the enquiries follow.</p>

      <h2>What the ads bring in</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Garage to living room or lounge</li>
        <li>Garage to home office or gym</li>
        <li>Garage to extra bedroom or annexe</li>
        <li>Garage to playroom or snug</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="split">
        <div class="prose" style="margin:0;">
          <h2>Why real footage wins</h2>
          <p>Nothing sells a conversion like seeing a bare, cold garage become a warm, finished room. That before-and-after is the whole pitch, and it's made for video. So we use <strong>real footage of your conversions</strong>, filmed on site or from finished jobs, never stock. It helps a homeowner picture their own garage transformed, which is exactly when they message you.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <figure style="max-width:300px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#14110c;">
            <video style="width:100%;display:block;" controls muted playsinline preload="none" poster="/clips/PGC_Showcase.jpg" aria-label="Garage conversion ad footage">
              <source src="/clips/PGC_Showcase.mp4" type="video/mp4">
