      <h2>What the funnel asks</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>What will the space become, a room, office, gym or bedroom?</li>
        <li>Is it a single or double garage, attached or detached?</li>
        <li>What type of property, and the postcode?</li>
        <li>When are they looking to get it done, and the best number to reach them.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>That sorts the homeowners serious about adding space from the ones just wondering, so you're quoting real conversions, not fielding idle questions.</p>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
    </div>

